OL,3,AMore than 350 killed in Nepal as
OL,4,Aexperts warn of possible second flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescuers are looking for survivors
OL,7,Fafter a massive flash flood on the
OL,8,FNepal-Tibet border destroyed homes,
OL,9,Fswamped roads, and swept away bridges
OL,11,FMore than 900 people are missing and at
OL,12,Fleast 359 have died in Nepal
OL,14,FIn Tibet, at least 558 people are
OL,15,Fmissing, with three confirmed dead -
OL,16,Fit's not clear if these figures overlap
OL,17,Fwith Nepal's
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
