OL,3,AMore than 350 killed in Nepal as
OL,4,Aexperts warn of possible second flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn both sides of the border, hundreds
OL,7,Fof foreigners are missing - Nepal says
OL,8,Fthat includes 178 tourists from India,
OL,9,F127 from Nepal, 65 Americans, and 33
OL,10,Ffrom the UK. Dozens of army and police
OL,11,Fpersonnel are also missing
OL,13,FThe US Geological Survey says "glacial
OL,14,Fcollapse and debris flow" triggered the
OL,15,Ffloods - and there are fears of more
OL,16,Ffloods
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
